     "text": "The basilar artery is the main blood supply to the brain stem.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "quote": "basilar artery: formed from the fusion of the two vertebral arteries; sends branches to the cerebellum, brain stem, and the posterior cerebral arteries; the main blood supply to the brain stem",
       "section": "Chapter 20 Key Terms (The Cardiovascular System: Blood Vessels and Circulation)",
