      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The brain stem, the part of the brain that joins the spinal cord, controls breathing and heart rate.",
     "defines": "brain stem",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "quote": "brainstem: portion of the brain that connects with the spinal cord; controls basic nervous system functions like breathing, heart rate, and swallowing",
       "section": "Chapter 35 Key Terms (The Nervous System)",
